{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚解释了此前反复用力为何会在身体松动后让被压住的牵挂浮现，也说明亲近感重新增强为何反而使正在流逝的时间变得刺痛、令温柔转为迫切，并进一步解释了从抓取转向轻轻看着如何改变他面对愿望的方式；相对薄弱处是部分心理目标属于推演，且关于用力无效、不能保证结果的解释有所重复。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙清楚交代了强撑失效、抵抗暂歇、愿望浮现、重新相连的盼望使表达变得更充实迫切这一因果链，也解释了为何愿望充分显现仍不能带来回应；但它对安宁如何转为带有酸楚的急迫解释得较少，也没有展开放轻抓取、转而珍惜眼前之物这一应对方式如何反过来改变感受。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"甲 版不差于 乙 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲不仅包含乙的身体松动、愿望显现与盼望加深的因果链，还进一步说明了亲近感为何会引出流逝感与急迫，以及不再强求结果如何改变他对珍惜之物的态度，尽管部分推演略显重复，但没有造成实质性的解释退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "499cf673-aa61-48fe-985c-0b210c0b7c0e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140153542806Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:02:55.577712+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6e2f60327461272c2a1f455d5762807cb677fa55310b9151213e2c27b3087901", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa